# Home (source/screens/home.c; the carousel, source/screens/carousel.c) in
# the light theme with the clock set (12:34 at the right): the default
# card's items (Recent from its v0.3 list, GBA's games, SD card, NOR,
# Settings, Info) with Recent at the front, as at boot (#1). RIGHT turns to
# Game Boy Advance (#2), every frame of the step hashed (#4); three LEFTs go
# back round the end past Info to Settings (#3), two more to SD card (#23).
#! settings 28=1
-C 1792586096
-w "nav: home ready"
-s @1:recent.png
-k @8:RIGHT -k @12:-
-H @8:@20
-w "home: facing gba"
-s @1:gba.png
-k @8:LEFT -k @12:- -k @24:LEFT -k @28:- -k @40:LEFT -k @44:-
-w "home: facing settings"
-s @1:settings.png
-k @8:LEFT -k @12:- -k @24:LEFT -k @28:-
-w "home: facing sd"
-s @1:sd.png
